  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Yin Liu Gong names a yaksha octopus in Earth Trench that is wrecking black oil extraction, with contribution point rewards for chasing it away or killing it. Fang Yuan wants a treasure deep inside that is guarded by yaksha octopuses, and that prize is why he joins Northern Plains Zombie Alliance.",
      "chapters": [
        741
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_yin_liu_gong",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "fac_zombie_alliance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Below Dark Flow Giant City the entrance is a giant gully like the bloody mouth of a vicious beast, opening quietly in dense darkness. Deeper in, the gully expands by tens and even hundreds of times, grand enough to hold innumerable Dark Flow Giant Cities, extremely deep and dark.",
      "chapters": [
        743
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Across the five regions, Earth Trenches are giant ravines, some stretching for millions of li and some tens of thousand of kilometers deep, among the Gu Master world’s most magnificent natural wonders.",
      "chapters": [
        931
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The most popular Zombie Alliance mission is to go deep into Earth Trench and collect black oil. Spreading black oil in a dead aperture slows blessed land disintegration, and outside it is a widely used Gu refinement material. Black oil from Earth Trench is the alliance’s most important trading item. Immortal zombies who extract it keep what they gather beyond the mission quota, so the profit is openly ranked among the best for them. Fang Yuan wants that mission so he can enter and take an inheritance left by a great expert immortal zombie, with research on immortal zombie rebirth that, in his previous life, let Northern Plains immortal zombies surge in strength.",
      "chapters": [
        742
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "black-oil-trade",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "res_black_oil",
        "sys_immortal_zombie"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Northern Plains Zombie Alliance’s main headquarters, Dark Flow Giant City, sits above the entrance and commits much of the alliance’s strength to guarding it. Fang Yuan sees the entrance as a giant gully in dense darkness; Yin Liu Gong, Dragon Commander Ye Cha, and Huang Quan Weng take turns watching it. Deeper in, the gully expands by tens and even hundreds of times. The trench is grand enough to hold innumerable Dark Flow Giant Cities, extremely deep and dark, and the alliance has not explored its true depths.",
      "chapters": [
        743
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "entrance-under-dark-flow-giant-city",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_dark_flow_giant_city",
        "char_dragon_commander_ye_cha",
        "char_huang_quan_weng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yao Huang tells Yin Liu Gong that Zombie Alliance has a graveyard in Earth Trench where past generations of immortal zombies are buried. Yin Liu Gong refuses to dig those corpses up, saying the dead should rest in peace and that such a move would ruin the alliance’s reputation.",
      "chapters": [
        757
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "graveyard-mention",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_yao_huang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Not only Northern Plains has an Earth Trench; the five regions each have one. They are giant ravines, some stretching for millions of li and some tens of thousand of kilometers deep, treated among the Gu Master world’s most magnificent natural wonders. When Blazing Heaven Demoness is away, at least one of Yin Liu Gong, Dragon Commander Ye Cha, and Huang Quan Weng guards the entrance. Dark Flow Giant City was built here to occupy that rich resource point; Northern Plains has fewer cultivation resources than the other four regions, but Earth Trench holds a huge rich area filled with powerful desolate plants and beasts. Only super forces normally occupy such a point. Northern Plains Zombie Alliance does so here, while Central Continent’s Demon Expelling Sect controls An Zu Earth Trench.",
      "chapters": [
        931
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "descent-and-scale",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_blazing_heaven_demoness",
        "reg_central_continent",
        "loc_an_zu_earth_trench"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan and other immortal zombies enter through the gate. After flying down for several minutes, the interior is already wide enough to fit seventy or eighty Dark Flow Giant Cities. Even long control has not reached the bottom. The alliance only holds about one hundred and sixty kilometers from the surface.",
      "chapters": [
        931
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "descent-and-scale",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In Fang Yuan’s previous life, Northern Plains Zombie Alliance becomes strong enough to surpass the Eastern Sea headquarters, and the explanation they give is that an inheritance lay in Earth Trench.",
      "chapters": [
        935
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inheritance-claim",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_eastern_sea"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan obtains a revival method there and, after collecting revival methods since Imperial Court blessed land was destroyed, treats it as the best and most suitable method for himself.",
      "chapters": [
        938
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "revival-method",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_imperial_court_blessed_land"
      ]
    }
  ],
